{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "halloween",
  "name": "Halloween",
  "description": "Mossy hollow under a dusky purple sky. An iron-fenced graveyard holds lavender gravestones and a mausoleum flanked by fire baskets, with a vulture on the roof and a ghost drifting between graves. Jack-o'-lanterns glow in a fenced pumpkin patch around a prize pumpkin; a cauldron simmers on a campfire ringed by candles beside a stone altar. A gravekeeper, skeleton, and zombie haunt a fresh grave, a vampire lurks by the cauldron, and lightposts ring the lantern square among crooked pines.",
